power-profiles-daemon: power-profiles-daemon (power handling over d-bus)
power-profiles-daemon:
power-profiles-daemon: power-profiles-daemon offers to modify system behavior based upon
power-profiles-daemon: user-selected power profiles. There are 3 different power profiles,
power-profiles-daemon: a "balanced" default mode, a "power-saver" mode, as well as a
power-profiles-daemon: "performance" mode. The first 2 of those are available on every
power-profiles-daemon: system. The "performance" mode is only available on select systems
power-profiles-daemon: and is implemented by different "drivers" based on the system or
power-profiles-daemon: systems it targets.
